{title: Goodness of God (FJ_49_en)}
{song_number: 49}
{language: en}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[A]I love You, Lord. Oh, Your mercy never [D]fails me.
All my [A]days I've been held in Your [E/G#]hands.
From the [F#m7]moment that I [D]wake up
until I lay my [A]head, I will sing
of the [D]goodness [Esus4]of [A]God.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[D]All my life You have been [A]faithful.
[D]All my life You have been [A]so, so [Esus4]good.
[D]With every breath that [A]I am [E/G#]a[F#m7]ble,
I will sing of the [D]goodness [Esus4]of [A]God.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[A]I love Your voice. You have led me through the [D]fire.
In darkest [A]night, You are close like no [E/G#]other.
I've [F#m7]known You as a [D]father,
I've known You as a [A]friend. I have lived
in the [D]goodness [Esus4]of [A]God.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[D]All my life You have been [A]faithful.
[D]All my life You have been [A]so, so [Esus4]good.
[D]With every breath that [A]I am [E/G#]a[F#m7]ble,
I will sing of the [D]goodness [Esus4]of [A]God.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge}
[A]Your goodness is [D]running after, it's [Esus4]running after [A]me.
[A]Your goodness is [D]running after, it's [Esus4]running after [A]me.
With my life [A/C#]laid down, I'm surren[D]dered now;
I give [Esus4]You every[F#m7]thing.
[A]Your goodness is [D]running after, it's [Esus4]running after [A]me.
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_chorus}
[D]All my life You have been [A]faithful.
[D]All my life You have been [A]so, so [Esus4]good.
[D]With every breath that [A]I am [E/G#]a[F#m7]ble,
I will sing of the [D]goodness [Esus4]of [A]God.
